[05:39.17]W: Okay, but what if I buy the tickets and then can't attend the concert£¿ 
[05:44.08]Can I get my money back easily£¿
[05:46.30]M: Many resale websites have clear refund policies. 
[05:49.77]You can usually return the tickets and get a full refund, which is actually a big advantage over official sellers.
[05:57.07]W: That's reassuring. 
