[06:02.40]Is that a problem£¿
[06:03.79]M: It can be. 
[06:05.28]Some resale services collaborate with third parties and don't take responsibility for issues. 
[06:11.25]So you really need to do a background check before buying anything.
[06:15.46]W: Got it. So resale seems convenient overall, but I need to be careful and choose verified sellers to avoid unpleasant surprises.
[06:25.56]M: Exactly. It's a great option when tickets are sold out; just don't rush into any deal without checking the fees and seller reputation first.
