[23:25.99]Recording Three
[23:27.93]Intelligence in any form is a superpower that can enhance every part of your life, from personal to business. 
[23:36.93]The good news is that intelligence is flexible; you can expand it with consistent work and the right habits.
[23:45.12]So, whether you are a great thinker or just an average one, these daily practices can make you smarter than you might think.
